{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1385407-contagion-chronicle-discussion-thread-evolved","id":1385407,"title":"Contagion Chronicle Discussion Thread: Evolved","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-03T08:16:16-07:00","id":1385407,"title":"Contagion Chronicle Discussion Thread: Evolved","content":"Last one was over a year old. Thought this one would be nice. I also had a lore question I wanted to ask to people with more knowledge of the subject personally.<br /> <br /> Why is the Ship of Theseus a Sworn group instead of a False group? From my understanding, the Sworn generally try to contain and quash the Contagion, while the False try to benefit from it. Unless I'm wrong, why does a group focused on personal evolution, who see the Contagion as a force of change to be harness, a Sworn Group? That sounds like archetypal False motivation..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T08:54:54-07:00","id":1385416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1385407-contagion-chronicle-discussion-thread-evolved#post1385407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is the Ship of Theseus a Sworn group instead of a False group? From my understanding, the Sworn generally try to contain and quash the Contagion, while the False try to benefit from it. Unless I'm wrong, why does a group focused on personal evolution, who see the Contagion as a force of change to be harness, a Sworn Group? That sounds like archetypal False motivation..</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the three main False groups operates on a hefty dose of Kill It With Fire re: the Contagion, and it uses the same Vector as the other two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T09:12:53-07:00","id":1385417,"title":"","content":"I see. I misunderstood the nature of the Sworn vs. False conflict. My bad","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T10:12:31-07:00","id":1385426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1385407-contagion-chronicle-discussion-thread-evolved?p=1385417#post1385417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see. I misunderstood the nature of the Sworn vs. False conflict. My bad</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the big thing about the False is their goals are inherently selfish and ignore (or embrace, in Naglfar's Army's case) the consequences. The Ship of Theseus views the Contagion as something that can be used for their benefit, but they want to share the benefits. They are the people trying to lift the Quiescence, stop the need of Beasts to feed on only terror, free the Huntsmen forever, that kind of thing. Even the Cryptocracy just wants everyone to be safe (it helps they respect mortals as part of their mission statement).<br /> <br /> The Crucible Initiative wants to save their own hides, and the people they actually know, first and foremost, and don't care about treating it at all if they're safe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T02:34:50-07:00","id":1385565,"title":"","content":"I still don't understand why Crucible Initiative are members of the False, considering the other two members want to either use the contagion or let it run rampant. Wouldn't the crucible initiative be at constant loggerheads with the gambit and the army?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25545-jollycooperative","name":"jollycooperative","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T11:41:00-07:00","id":1385628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jollycooperative</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1385407-contagion-chronicle-discussion-thread-evolved?p=1385565#post1385565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still don't understand why Crucible Initiative are members of the False, considering the other two members want to either use the contagion or let it run rampant. Wouldn't the crucible initiative be at constant loggerheads with the gambit and the army?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, you're assuming the False and Sworn are unified political factions rather than a descriptor for the general ideology plus whether they use the Contagion itself. If the <i>Sworn </i>aren't, the selfish factions certainly aren't. So yeah, they are; they're the Swornest False, and were Sworn before they succumbed to extremism.<br /> <br /> But as noted, the reason they're considered False, besides their hypocrisy in using the Contagion Vector to fight the Contagion, is that the rest of the world can burn; they're out to save what's important to <i>them </i>most efficiently and simply, they don't care about collateral damage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T12:42:41-07:00","id":1385637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1385407-contagion-chronicle-discussion-thread-evolved?p=1385628#post1385628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, you're assuming the False and Sworn are unified political factions rather than a descriptor for the general ideology plus whether they use the Contagion itself. If the <i>Sworn </i>aren't, the selfish factions certainly aren't. So yeah, they are; they're the Swornest False, and were Sworn before they succumbed to extremism.<br /> <br /> But as noted, the reason they're considered False, besides their hypocrisy in using the Contagion Vector to fight the Contagion, is that the rest of the world can burn; they're out to save what's important to <i>them </i>most efficiently and simply, they don't care about collateral damage.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well it definitely makes more sense if Sworn and False are more general descriptors of ideology, which is something I failed to grasp from the text. Thanks for the clarification.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25545-jollycooperative","name":"jollycooperative","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T04:19:57-07:00","id":1385795,"title":"","content":"I only just started to run <b>Contagion Chronicle</b> inside my Viking <b>Werewolf </b>game - but, from what I see it, Sworn and False are just <i>very loose</i> alliances of particular monsters, rarely groups like coteries, packs, cabals, etc. Your local Sworn, for example, are 'people you call when Conatgion is in town' - and pass some time on week-to-week relations. Like some work buddies from far company departments that come to see on needs of particular project. You can call them from time to time on other things, but they are nowhere near the same camdrie level like your Covenant-, Order- or Tribe-like groups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}